  "title": "India's Expansion of Airports and Regional Connectivity",
  "summary": "The Centre plans to build 100 new airports in India over the next 10 years, expanding air connectivity beyond major cities and addressing challenges in air travel infrastructure. The Indian government, under the 'UDAN' regional connectivity scheme, has announced a Rs 30,000 crore investment to achieve this goal.",
