      "title": "India plans 100 new airports to connect smaller cities, remote regions",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/india-news/india-plans-100-new-airports-to-connect-smaller-cities-remote-regions-126090200731_1.html",
      "description": "The Centre's 10-year airport expansion plan aims to take air connectivity beyond major cities, while addressing challenges that affected earlier UDAN routes",
